{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41176","headline":"登白马山护明寺 · 孔德绍","name":"登白马山护明寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"名岳标形胜，危峰远郁纡。\n成象建环极，大壮阐规模。\n层台从灵鹫，高殿迩阳乌。\n暂同游阆苑，还类入仙都。\n三休开碧岭，万户洞金铺。\n摄心罄前礼，访道挹中虚。\n遥瞻尽地轴，长望极天隅。\n白云起梁栋，丹霞映栱栌。\n露花疑濯锦，泉月似沈珠。\n今日桃源客，相顾失归涂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孔德绍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41176.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41176","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}